<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In AcT2I: Evaluating and Improving Action Depiction inText-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Qualitative Evidence of Semantic Enrichment</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In AcT2I: Evaluating and Improving Action Depiction inText-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>More results on Automated Metric</span></a>
