<span id="A5.T7.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">[mammal|reptile] eating [mammal|bird|reptile]</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"></td>
